I usually have a good 2 to 3 unicorn horns when I die (aka, after
sokoban).

So I'm sure you can get more horns eventually.

Polymorph potions are not the only thing you can use btw, wands and
spellbooks can be used as well.

Unicorn horns have a 60% chance of becomming one of these:

    * bag of holding
    * bag of tricks
    * magic lamp
    * crystal ball
    * unicorn horn
    * figurine
    * magic marker
    * magic whistle
    * magic flute
    * frost horn
    * fire horn
    * horn of plenty
    * magic harp
    * drum of earthquake

Of those, the following are tops: BoH, magic lamp, magic
marker. So thats ~12% chance that you get a really really good item
from polymorphing a unicorn horn (not saying those other items
suck either. Frost horns == awesomeness)

